d</span><span begin="00:21.180" end="00:21.180">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.180" end="00:22.380"><span begin="00:21.180" end="00:21.480">And </span><span begin="00:21.480" end="00:21.990">so </span><span begin="00:21.990" end="00:22.380">we're</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.410" end="00:24.870"><span begin="00:22.410" end="00:22.890">Running </span><span begin="00:22.890" end="00:23.190">just </span><span begin="00:23.190" end="00:23.340">as </span><span begin="00:23.340" end="00:23.670">fast </span><span begin="00:23.670" end="00:23.850">as </span><span begin="00:23.850" end="00:23.970">we </span><span begin="00:23.970" end="00:24.870">can</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.070" end="00:28.530"><span begin="00:26.070" end="00:26.640">Holding </span><span begin="00:26.640" end="00:26.820">on </span><span begin="00:26.820" end="00:27.030">to </span><span begin="00:27.030" end="00:27.360">one </span><span begin="00:27.360" end="00:28.020">another </span><span begin="00:28.020" end="00:28.530">hands</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.670" end="00:32.880"><span begin="00:29.670" end="00:30.390">Trying </span><span begin="00:30.390" end="00:30.480">to </span><span begin="00:30.480" end="00:31.050">get </span><span begin="00:31.050" end="00:31.680">away </span><span begin="00:31.680" end="00:32.100">into </span><span begin="00:32.100" end="00:32.250">the </span><span begin="00:32.250" end="00:32.880">night</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.880" end="00:37.860"><span begin="00:32.880" end="00:33.030">And </span><span begin="00:33.030" end="00:33.300">then </span><span begin="00:33.300" end="00:33.420">you </span><span begin="00:33.420" end="00:33.750">put </span><span begin="00:33.750" end="00:34.050">your </span><span begin="00:34.050" end="00:34.290">arms </span><span begin="00:34.290" end="00:34.680">around </span><span begin="00:34.680" end="00:34.980">me </span><span begin="00:34.980" end="00:35.160">and </span><span begin="